<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>PixelForge — Premium Web Design Agency</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0a0a0f;
            --surface: #12121a;
            --surface-2: #1a1a26;
            --border: #252536;
            --text: #e8e8f0;
            --text-muted: #9494b0;
            --accent: #7c5cfc;
            --accent-glow: #7c5cfc55;
            --accent-2: #f06595;
            --gradient-1: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c5cfc 0%, #5b8def 50%, #6c5ce7 100%);
            --gradient-2: linear-gradient(135deg, #f06595 0%, #f76767 100%);
            --radius: 16px;
            --radius-sm: 10px;
            --transition: 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
        }

        /* ── Animated background grid ── */
        .bg-grid {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
            opacity: 0.03;
            background-image:
                linear-gradient(#ffffff 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, #ffffff 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 60px 60px;
            mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 50% 40%, black 30%, transparent 70%);
            -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 50% 40%, black 30%, transparent 70%);
        }

        .bg-orb {
            position: fixed;
            border-radius: 50%;
            filter: blur(120px);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
            opacity: 0.4;
        }
        .bg-orb--1 {
            width: 500px;
            height: 500px;
            background: #7c5cfc;
            top: -15%;
            left: -10%;
            animation: floatOrb 14s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        .bg-orb--2 {
            width: 400px;
            height: 400px;
            background: #f06595;
            bottom: -12%;
            right: -8%;
            animation: floatOrb 18s ease-in-out infinite reverse;
        }
        .bg-orb--3 {
            width: 300px;
            height: 300px;
            background: #5b8def;
            top: 50%;
            left: 55%;
            animation: floatOrb 20s ease-in-out infinite 3s;
        }

        @keyframes floatOrb {
            0%,
            100% {
                transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1);
            }
            25% {
                transform: translate(40px, -50px) scale(1.1);
            }
            50% {
                transform: translate(-30px, 30px) scale(0.9);
            }
            75% {
                transform: translate(-50px, -20px) scale(1.05);
            }
        }

        /* ── Layout ── */
        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 24px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        /* ── Navigation ── */
        .nav {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            padding: 16px 0;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }
        .nav.scrolled {
            background: rgba(10, 10, 15, 0.75);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 10px 0;
        }
        .nav .container {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }
        .nav__logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text);
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }
        .nav__logo:hover {
            opacity: 0.85;
        }
        .nav__logo-icon {
            width: 38px;
            height: 38px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: var(--gradient-1);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px var(--accent-glow);
        }
        .nav__cta {
            padding: 10px 22px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            background: var(--gradient-1);
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            letter-spacing: -0.01em;
            transition: var(--transition);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px var(--accent-glow);
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .nav__cta:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(124, 92, 252, 0.5);
        }

        /* ── Hero ── */
        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 140px 0 80px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        .hero__content {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 60px;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .hero__badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            background: var(--surface-2);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 50px;
            padding: 8px 18px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease-out;
        }
        .hero__badge-dot {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #4ade80;
            animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulse {
            0%,
            100% {
                box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.5);
            }
            50% {
                box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(74, 222, 128, 0);
            }
        }
        .hero__title {
            font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5.5vw, 4.2rem);
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.08;
            letter-spacing: -0.03em;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease-out 0.1s both;
        }
        .hero__title span {
            background: var(--gradient-1);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }
        .hero__subtitle {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            max-width: 460px;
            margin-bottom: 36px;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease-out 0.2s both;
        }
        .hero__actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 14px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease-out 0.3s both;
        }
        .btn {
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            letter-spacing: -0.01em;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: none;
            transition: var(--transition);
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        .btn--primary {
            background: var(--gradient-1);
            color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 28px var(--accent-glow);
        }
        .btn--primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(124, 92, 252, 0.5);
        }
        .btn--outline {
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--text);
            border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
        }
        .btn--outline:hover {
            border-color: #7c5cfc;
            background: rgba(124, 92, 252, 0.06);
        }

        /* Hero visual */
        .hero__visual {
            position: relative;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.7s ease-out 0.25s both;
        }
        .hero__card-stack {
            position: relative;
            height: 420px;
        }
        .hero__card {
            position: absolute;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            transition: var(--transition);
        }
        .hero__card--1 {
            width: 320px;
            height: 380px;
            top: 0;
            right: 0;
            z-index: 3;
            animation: cardFloat 6s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        .hero__card--2 {
            width: 280px;
            height: 340px;
            top: 50px;
            right: 160px;
            z-index: 2;
            opacity: 0.7;
            animation: cardFloat 6s ease-in-out infinite 1s;
        }
        .hero__card--3 {
            width: 240px;
            height: 300px;
            top: 90px;
            right: 300px;
            z-index: 1;
            opacity: 0.45;
            animation: cardFloat 6s ease-in-out infinite 2s;
        }
        @keyframes cardFloat {
            0%,
            100% {
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
            50% {
                transform: translateY(-14px);
            }
        }
        .hero__card-bar {
            height: 28px;
            background: var(--surface-2);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 14px;
            gap: 6px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }
        .hero__card-dot {
            width: 10px;
            height: 10px;
            border-radius: 50%;
        }
        .hero__card-dot--r {
            background: #f06595;
        }
        .hero__card-dot--y {
            background: #fbbf24;
        }
        .hero__card-dot--g {
            background: #4ade80;
        }
        .hero__card-body {
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
        }
        .hero__card-line {
            height: 10px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            background: var(--surface-2);
        }
        .hero__card-line--short {
            width: 60%;
        }
        .hero__card-line--medium {
            width: 80%;
        }
        .hero__card-image {
            height: 140px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
            background: var(--gradient-1);
            opacity: 0.3;
            margin-top: 6px;
        }

        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(30px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        /* ── Section styling ── */
        .section {
            padding: 100px 0;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        .section__label {
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #7c5cfc;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .section__title {
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.8rem);
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }
        .section__subtitle {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            max-width: 500px;
        }

        /* ── Services ── */
        .services-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 50px;
        }
        .service-card {
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            padding: 32px 28px;
            transition: var(--transition);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .service-card:hover {
            border-color: #7c5cfc55;
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
        }
        .service-card__icon {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }
        .service-card__icon--purple {
            background: rgba(124, 92, 252, 0.15);
            color: #7c5cfc;
        }
        .service-card__icon--pink {
            background: rgba(240, 101, 149, 0.15);
            color: #f06595;
        }
        .service-card__icon--blue {
            background: rgba(91, 141, 239, 0.15);
            color: #5b8def;
        }
        .service-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        }
        .service-card p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* ── Waitlist Section ── */
        .waitlist-section {
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 56px 48px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-top: 50px;
        }
        .waitlist-section::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: -30%;
            width: 300px;
            height: 300px;
            background: #7c5cfc;
            border-radius: 50%;
            filter: blur(100px);
            opacity: 0.12;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .waitlist-section::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -40%;
            right: -20%;
            width: 250px;
            height: 250px;
            background: #f06595;
            border-radius: 50%;
            filter: blur(100px);
            opacity: 0.1;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .waitlist-section>* {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }
        .waitlist-section h2 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .waitlist-section .subtitle {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }
        .waitlist-form {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .waitlist-form input {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 240px;
            padding: 14px 20px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
            background: var(--surface-2);
            color: var(--text);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            outline: none;
            transition: var(--transition);
            font-family: inherit;
        }
        .waitlist-form input:focus {
            border-color: #7c5cfc;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(124, 92, 252, 0.1);
        }
        .waitlist-form input::placeholder {
            color: #5a5a70;
        }
        .waitlist-form button {
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            background: var(--gradient-1);
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 600;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            transition: var(--transition);
            white-space: nowrap;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px var(--accent-glow);
            font-family: inherit;
        }
        .waitlist-form button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(124, 92, 252, 0.45);
        }
        .waitlist-form button:disabled {
            opacity: 0.6;
            cursor: not-allowed;
            transform: none;
        }
        .waitlist-counter {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 6px;
        }
        .waitlist-counter strong {
            color: #4ade80;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }
        .waitlist-success {
            display: none;
            color: #4ade80;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-top: 12px;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.4s ease-out;
        }
        .waitlist-success.visible {
            display: block;
        }
        .waitlist-error {
            display: none;
            color: #f76767;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-top: 8px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.4s ease-out;
        }
        .waitlist-error.visible {
            display: block;
        }

        /* ── Testimonials ── */
        .testimonials-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 50px;
        }
        .testimonial-card {
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            padding: 28px;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }
        .testimonial-card:hover {
            border-color: #7c5cfc44;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }
        .testimonial-card__stars {
            color: #fbbf24;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .testimonial-card p {
            color: var(--text);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.55;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            font-style: italic;
        }
        .testimonial-card__author {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        .testimonial-card__avatar {
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--gradient-1);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .testimonial-card__name {
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }
        .testimonial-card__role {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
        }

        /* ── Footer ── */
        .footer {
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 40px 0;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        .footer p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }
        .footer__logo {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--text);
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        /* ── Responsive ── */
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .hero__content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 40px;
            }
            .hero__card-stack {
                height: 300px;
                max-width: 400px;
                margin: 0 auto;
            }
            .hero__card--1 {
                width: 240px;
                height: 290px;
                right: 10px;
            }
            .hero__card--2 {
                width: 200px;
                height: 250px;
                right: 110px;
                top: 35px;
            }
            .hero__card--3 {
                width: 170px;
                height: 210px;
                right: 190px;
                top: 60px;
            }
            .hero__card-image {
                height: 90px;
            }
            .services-grid,
            .testimonials-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            }
            .waitlist-section {
                padding: 36px 24px;
            }
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .services-grid,
            .testimonials-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .hero {
                padding: 110px 0 50px;
                min-height: auto;
            }
            .hero__card-stack {
                height: 220px;
                max-width: 280px;
            }
            .hero__card--1 {
                width: 180px;
                height: 210px;
                right: 0;
            }
            .hero__card--2 {
                width: 150px;
                height: 180px;
                right: 80px;
                top: 25px;
            }
            .hero__card--3 {
                display: none;
            }
            .hero__card-image {
                height: 60px;
            }
            .hero__card-body {
                padding: 12px;
                gap: 8px;
            }
            .hero__card-line {
                height: 7px;
            }
            .nav__cta {
                padding: 8px 16px;
                font-size: 0.8rem;
            }
            .nav__logo {
                font-size: 1.1rem;
            }
            .waitlist-form {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: stretch;
            }
            .waitlist-form input {
                min-width: auto;
            }
            .section {
                padding: 60px 0;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Background Effects -->
    <div class="bg-grid"></div>
    <div class="bg-orb bg-orb--1"></div>
    <div class="bg-orb bg-orb--2"></div>
    <div class="bg-orb bg-orb--3"></div>

    <!-- Navigation -->
    <nav class="nav" id="nav">
        <div class="container">
            <a href="#" class="nav__logo">
                <div class="nav__logo-icon">◆</div>
                PixelForge
            </a>
            <a href="#waitlist" class="nav__cta">Join Waitlist</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="hero__content">
                <div class="hero__text">
                    <div class="hero__badge">
                        <span class="hero__badge-dot"></span> Accepting clients soon
                    </div>
                    <h1 class="hero__title">
                        We craft <span>stunning</span> digital experiences
                    </h1>
                    <p class="hero__subtitle">
                        PixelForge is a boutique web design agency building high-performance,
                        conversion-focused websites for ambitious brands. Launching soon — be first in line.
                    </p>
                    <div class="hero__actions">
                        <a href="#waitlist" class="btn btn--primary">🔒 Secure Your Spot</a>
                        <a href="#services" class="btn btn--outline">Explore Services ↓</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="hero__visual">
                    <div class="hero__card-stack">
                        <div class="hero__card hero__card--1">
                            <div class="hero__card-bar">
                                <span class="hero__card-dot hero__card-dot--r"></span>
                                <span class="hero__card-dot hero__card-dot--y"></span>
                                <span class="hero__card-dot hero__card-dot--g"></span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="hero__card-body">
                                <div class="hero__card-line" style="width: 35%;"></div>
                                <div class="hero__card-line hero__card-line--medium"></div>
                                <div class="hero__card-line hero__card-line--short"></div>
                                <div class="hero__card-image"></div>
                                <div class="hero__card-line hero__card-line--medium"></div>
                                <div class="hero__card-line" style="width: 45%;"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="hero__card hero__card--2">
                            <div class="hero__card-bar">
                                <span class="hero__card-dot hero__card-dot--r"></span>
                                <span class="hero__card-dot hero__card-dot--y"></span>
                                <span class="hero__card-dot hero__card-dot--g"></span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="hero__card-body">
